+    },
+    {
+      "path": "./styles/242-doraemon.png",
+      "prompt": "Use case: stylized-concept. Create ONE fresh, square 1024x1024 illustration from text only, with no reference images. Style priority: authentic Doraemon / Fujiko F. Fujio comic and television cartoon style. Extremely simple round shapes, charming elastic simplified anatomy, large round white eyes with tiny black pupils, small round hands and feet, clean even black contour lines, soft flat colors and very sparse shading. An intimate Japanese suburban room with tatami floor, sliding doors and a low rounded table. A slightly elevated, wide room composition showing the woman sitting cross-legged, full figure, beside a friendly blue robotic cat companion with round white face and belly and a red nose. The woman is an adult in her early 30s, rendered in this very simple round cartoon language: curly auburn shoulder-length hair drawn as a few scalloped lobes, a few freckle dots, round tortoiseshell glasses, and mustard-yellow knit sweater indicated with only a few simple rib lines. She happily enjoys a cup of coffee with both rounded hands, eyes wide with contentment. A croissant sits on a small plate on the low table within reach. Pastel mint, cream, sky blue and peach, an airy uncluttered layout. Let the cartoon style completely dictate proportions, pose, framing, setting, palette and medium. No realism, photographic detail or glossy rendering. No text, captions, signatures, logos or watermarks."
+    },
+    {
+      "path": "./styles/243-kyoani.png",
+      "prompt": "Use case: stylized-concept. Create ONE fresh, square 1024x1024 illustration from text only, with no reference images. Style priority: Kyoto Animation slice-of-life anime, a delicate polished hand-drawn animation keyframe, fine precise linework, glossy detailed expressive eyes, translucent delicate hair highlights, soft painted pastel backgrounds, warm afternoon glow and softly painted bokeh lights. Close-up three-quarter profile portrait of an adult woman in her early 30s seated beside a sunlit window in a gentle pastel school café, lifting a small porcelain coffee cup to her lips with a relaxed smile as she enjoys its aroma. The tight asymmetrical framing centers her expressive eye, freckles across her nose, and round tortoiseshell glasses, with curly auburn shoulder-length hair cascading into the warm light. She wears a mustard-yellow knit sweater with beautifully drawn soft folds. Include a clearly recognizable croissant on a small plate in the lower foreground on the café table. Peach, pale sage, buttery gold and lavender shadow colors; luminous highlights and delicate atmospheric softness, with crafted anime character proportions. This must be an authentic drawn slice-of-life anime illustration, not a photograph or a filter. No text, captions, signatures, logos or watermarks."
+    },
+    {
+      "path": "./styles/244-mob-psycho.png",
+      "prompt": "Use case: stylized-concept. Create ONE fresh, square 1024x1024 illustration from text only, with no reference images. Style priority: authentic Mob Psycho 100 anime experimental psychic animation aesthetic. Crude simple off-model character drawing, blunt uneven black outlines, flat awkward facial features and dotlike pupils, rubbery exaggerated anatomy, mixed painted and scribbled texture, wildly colorful explosive psychedelic psychic energy. A radically dynamic tilted overhead fisheye composition: an adult woman in her early 30s floats diagonally across the picture amid a swirling explosion of hand-drawn neon psychic shapes, one hand and a levitating coffee cup hugely foreshortened toward the viewer. She happily enjoys her coffee with an absurdly calm little satisfied smile as the cup floats just toward her mouth, surrounded by floating droplets. She has curly auburn shoulder-length hair simplified into loose scribbled loops, freckles, round tortoiseshell glasses and a mustard-yellow knit sweater simplified to a few rib marks. A croissant floats nearby on a tilted plate. Fragmentary café floor tiles and chair silhouettes bend into a psychedelic vortex. Electric cyan, magenta, lime, violet and orange clash in layered rough brush marks, ink splashes, bold irregular shapes and radial streaks. The crude character design should contrast with the extravagant psychic effect animation. Let the style completely determine anatomy, spatial distortion, color and framing. No photographic realism, no polished generic anime face, no text, numbers, captions, signatures, logos or watermarks."
+    }
+  ]
+}

